&lt;p>For example, some people will say, just configure X-Real-Ip, and that&amp;rsquo;s it.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Or some people will ask, what is the difference between X-Real-Ip and X-Forward-For, and what is the principle?&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Obviously, they misunderstood &lt;code>X-Real-Ip&lt;/code>.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>This article will show you what X-Real-Ip is.&lt;/p>
